    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Market Empire Simulator</strong> puts you in the role of a rising market owner, where your business skills and strategy will determine your success. Build, manage, and optimize your very own supermarket from the ground up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run Your Own Supermarket</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a modest store and turn it into the go-to shopping destination. Control everything from inventory to pricing, ensuring customers leave satisfied and keep coming back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hire and Manage Employees</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the right staff to keep your store running smoothly. Hire employees and maintain morale to maximize productivity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stock Your Shelves Wisely</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right products and arrange them strategically to attract customers. From everyday essentials to specialty items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand and Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your store with better equipment, more shelves, and a bigger layout.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize and Optimize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your store\u2019s layout for peak efficiency or focus on aesthetics to create a welcoming shopping experience. Every detail matters when it comes to running a thriving supermarket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to build the ultimate shopping empire? The challenge awaits in <strong>Market Empire Simulator!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Market Empire Simulator</strong> puts you in the role of a rising market owner, where your business skills and strategy will determine your success. Build, manage, and optimize your very own supermarket from the ground up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run Your Own Supermarket</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a modest store and turn it into the go-to shopping destination. Control everything from inventory to pricing, ensuring customers leave satisfied and keep coming back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hire and Manage Employees</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the right staff to keep your store running smoothly. Hire employees and maintain morale to maximize productivity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stock Your Shelves Wisely</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right products and arrange them strategically to attract customers. From everyday essentials to specialty items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand and Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your store with better equipment, more shelves, and a bigger layout.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize and Optimize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your store\u2019s layout for peak efficiency or focus on aesthetics to create a welcoming shopping experience. Every detail matters when it comes to running a thriving supermarket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to build the ultimate shopping empire? The challenge awaits in <strong>Market Empire Simulator!</strong></p>",
